<%- include('partials/header',{title}) %><div class="page-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">GOVERNANCE</p><h1>Issue policies</h1><p class="muted">Limits are enforced during transactional issue and renewal operations.</p></div></div><div class="form-page panel"><form method="post" action="/policies" class="form-grid"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrf %>"><label>Max active items per student<input type="number" min="1" name="max_items_per_student" value="<%= p.max_items_per_student %>" required></label><label>Max quantity per issue<input type="number" min="1" name="max_quantity_per_item_per_issue" value="<%= p.max_quantity_per_item_per_issue %>" required></label><label>Max renewals per issue<input type="number" min="0" name="max_renewals_per_issue" value="<%= p.max_renewals_per_issue %>" required></label><label>Upcoming due window (days)<input type="number" min="0" name="upcoming_due_days" value="<%= p.upcoming_due_days %>" required></label><div class="info-note col-span-full">Loan period is fixed at 15 days. Damaged, lost, maintenance and retired items cannot be issued. Approval adds 15 days to the current due date.</div><button class="primary-btn col-span-full">Save policies</button></form></div><%- include('partials/footer') %>